{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_020_02_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:2860037e401be47e211d04bb7b0c598cf5ffd31335cd57296c510339da6798c7",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59278d62b7763a1bc139f864621817142674d3f6d2381aeb282b782701b78988",
      "text": "早上好，旬！\n今天的碰头会也请多指教！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3677701f82850e244630f90ea0e3b45ef3611a184778d790d238ac68d310f23b",
      "text": "好的，请多指教。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddde52868db40bfdee6f18e3727a0555a211dceb5e2a9201fd923c245b286917",
      "text": "……总觉得你心情很好呢。\n遇到什么好事了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1e557dd75a84e90e47efe30a34df902d6d27421baedfcf797014871ff061cfa8",
      "text": "哎？没那回事啦。不过，令人开心的事\n接下来可能确实会有就是了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4ba5563d58085a4eb50c62ea5138137bc06370f88056f1ee53ba4d7cfc25be8f",
      "text": "啊，没有，刚才的话当我没说！\n快忘了快忘了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8e5212b5f769f96503052fb33d696500eae035c83a11d6beac46e79f4a3dcdee",
      "text": "哇啊，是蛋糕的商品目录！\n看起来每一个都好好吃啊……嘿嘿，真期待。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e910ee05f5cca888c5efbe562481b44e69377e99f9ee76977238ec96ae5f788f",
      "text": "（这……绝对是察觉到惊喜的事了吧……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f9ef42ccad879aabea252b0d7606b89723b3dc625f673c25eb15b4b5733c4bc",
      "text": "那个，旬先生。\n关于隼人先生的事……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000093:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f3ec9bcebd9b6a3d44a12733f9735871a25e06e38af88e9708efa00d94e1008e",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー也\n注意到了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:667ce7940898708a6d58a3f479ba8873094745499228495947cbcef6129cbac9",
      "text": "是的……该怎么办呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000100:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b40c775348ea27a1ee7c7bec0a67f5f04d37948bbd1dc4d4754d73fe5a2414dd",
      "text": "感觉会变得很麻烦，\n还是先别告诉他们本人了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_020hay_02_1_2_020_02:1_2_020_02_d:cmd-000104:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:19c62cc9662801e40884d2366a92df8a9d617af0c9a027a75c647c39ff9bee1a",
      "text": "说的也是呢。大家的计划也进入收尾阶段了，\n我也尽量表现得和平常一样吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
